</section>
<section id="S4.SS4.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">4.4.3 </span>Training and Inference Cost</h4>

<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
